10
00:55:33,333 --> 00:55:39,333
The Invention of Lying is a 2009 romantic comedy fantasy film written and directed by
comedian Ricky Gervais and writer Matthew Robinson in their directorial debuts.

11
01:01:06,666 --> 01:01:12,666
The film stars Gervais as the first human with the ability to lie
in a world where people can only tell the truth.

12
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
The cast also includes Jennifer Garner, Jonah Hill, Louis C.K., Jeffrey Tambor,
Fionnula Flanagan, Rob Lowe, Philip Seymour Hoffman and Tina Fey.

13
01:12:13,333 --> 01:12:19,333
The film premiered at the Toronto International Film Festival on September 14, 2009, and
was released in the United States on October 2, 2009, by Warner Bros.

14
